### Open WebUI Phase A - Python chat service
@host = http://127.0.0.1:13103
@apiKey = phase-a-dev-key

### Health
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Model list
GET {{host}}/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Chat completion
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "qwen-math-turbo",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "请分三点介绍上海。"
    }
  ]
}

### Stream chat completion
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "model": "qwen-math-turbo",
  "stream": true,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "请分三点介绍上海。"
    }
  ]
}
